{"meta":{"id":"form-submit","category":"it/syntax/html/form","title":"form 전송 (submit) · HTML","subtitle":"(HTML)","summary":"method · action, action 생략 시 자기 자신, js 에서 submit, target=_blank, get vs post","tags":["html","f-form","f-navigation"],"color":"orange","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-orange","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-orange-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 border border-orange-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>HTML</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">form 전송 (submit) · HTML</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-orange-50/70 border border-orange-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> method · action, action 생략 시 자기 자신, js 에서 submit, target=_blank, get vs post</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">form 전송</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">html</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&lt;!-- 1. action 주소로 전송 --&gt;\r\n&lt;form name=&quot;myform&quot; method=&quot;post&quot; action=&quot;${ctp}/member/join&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; name=&quot;mid&quot; /&gt;\r\n  &lt;input type=&quot;submit&quot; value=&quot;가입&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;/form&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;!-- 2. action 생략 — 현재 주소(자기 자신)로 전송 --&gt;\r\n&lt;form method=&quot;post&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;input type=&quot;submit&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;/form&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;!-- 3. js 에서 검사 후 전송, target=&quot;_blank&quot; 는 새 창 --&gt;\r\n&lt;form name=&quot;myform&quot; method=&quot;post&quot; action=&quot;주소&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;input type=&quot;button&quot; value=&quot;확인&quot; onclick=&quot;fCheck()&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;/form&gt;\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\n  &#x27;use strict&#x27;;\r\n  function fCheck() { myform.submit(); }\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">get vs post</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\"></th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">get</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">post</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">값 위치</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">주소 뒤 ?mid=kim</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">요청 본문(body)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">용도</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">조회 · 검색</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">저장 · 로그인 · 파일 업로드</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">길이 · 노출</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">짧음, 주소창에 보임</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">제한 적음, 안 보임</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-orange-700 font-semibold\">원본 메모의 &lt;from&gt; 은 &lt;form&gt; 의 오타, &lt;js&gt; 는 &lt;script&gt;. 파일 업로드는 enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" 추가.</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> JavaScript › 페이지 이동 · submit, Java › 실제 경로 · 파일 업로드</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/html/form/form-submit","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"html","title":"HTML","path":"it/syntax/html"},{"id":"form","title":"폼 · 입력","path":"it/syntax/html/form"}],"hasImage":false}